{"id":"edgerunnerscar","lines":[{"t":0,"end":2.193,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"Wchodzisz ty","de":"Du gehst rein.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":7.427,"end":11.992,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"Bierzesz klucz i przekazujesz dorio ona go skopiuje","de":"Du nimmst den Schlüssel und gibst ihn Dorio — sie kopiert ihn.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":12.426,"end":20.614,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"Then we go in and grab the nav data while Maxim's still out of it — we'll handle that.","de":"Dann gehen wir rein und holen uns die Navigationsdaten, solange Maxim noch außer Gefecht ist. Den Rest übernehmen wir.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":20.831,"end":27.606,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"You just gotta give him the key back before he notices. Piece of cake.","de":"Du musst ihm nur den Schlüssel zurückgeben, bevor er's merkt. Stück Kuchen.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":27.606,"end":30.396,"chars":[1],"who":"Kiwi","text":"Chwila, szef do niego dzwoni","de":"Moment, Boss — er ruft ihn an.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":30.758,"end":35.939,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"Damn, he can't even lie still. He won't rest till he's dead.","de":"Verdammt, der kann nicht mal in Ruhe liegen. Ruhe kriegt der erst, wenn er abkratzt.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":36.156,"end":37.823,"chars":[1],"who":"Kiwi","text":"Niedobrze wzywa go","de":"Schlecht — er ruft ihn.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":37.677,"end":39.416,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"He was supposed to have the day off.","de":"Dabei sollte der frei haben.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":39.416,"end":40.938,"chars":[1],"who":"Kiwi","text":"I'm not done copying yet.","de":"Ich bin noch nicht fertig mit dem Kopieren.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":40.938,"end":47.785,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"Fuck, change of plans — kid, start the car, Becca handle it.","de":"Scheiße, Planänderung. Junge, start den Wagen — Becca, erledig das.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":48.292,"end":50.067,"chars":[1],"who":"Kiwi","text":"Byle szybko","de":"Aber fix.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":52.821,"end":59.523,"chars":[5],"who":"Wachmann","text":"Hey watch out! Next ti—ooooouu","de":"Hey, pass auf! Beim nächsten Ma—ooooouu","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":52.821,"end":59.523,"chars":[2],"who":"Rebecca","text":"Oooooo oj przepraszam oooeeuu","de":"Oooooo — oh, sorry — oooeeuu","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":60.03,"end":63.182,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"Get in, pull the data before he shows up.","de":"Steig ein, zieh die Daten, bevor er auftaucht.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":63.762,"end":64.849,"chars":[3],"who":"David","text":"Ale jak?","de":"Aber wie?","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":64.849,"end":68.52,"chars":[4],"who":"Lucy","text":"I'll handle it. Just get in already.","de":"Ich mach das. Steig schon ein.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":70.247,"end":80.415,"chars":[3],"who":"David","text":"Wooooo ho- woooou, i jak","de":"Wooooo — ho — woooou, und? Wie sieht's aus?","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":80.5,"end":85.648,"chars":[4],"who":"Lucy","text":"Shh don't interrupt — ICE security is such a pain.","de":"Psst, nicht stören — die ICE-Sicherungen sind echt nervig.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":86.015,"end":88.169,"chars":[2],"who":"Rebecca","text":"Przepraszam przystojniaczku","de":"Sorry, hübscher.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":88.298,"end":90.388,"chars":[5],"who":"Wachmann","text":"Hey no problem sweetheart.","de":"Hey, kein Problem, Süße.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":90.129,"end":93.037,"chars":[2],"who":"Rebecca","text":"Next time I'll make it up to you!","de":"Beim nächsten Mal mach ich's wett!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":93.49,"end":95.967,"chars":[5],"who":"Wachmann","text":"Ty suko!","de":"Du Schlampe!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":95.364,"end":99.586,"chars":[2],"who":"Rebecca","text":"Aa don't yell at me I'm a sensitive person!","de":"Aa, schrei mich nicht an, ich bin 'ne sensible Person!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":99.585,"end":101.631,"chars":[1],"who":"Kiwi","text":"We've been made — we're running out of time.","de":"Wir sind aufgeflogen — uns läuft die Zeit weg.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":101.331,"end":102.516,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"Jak idzie?","de":"Wie weit?","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":102.516,"end":103.55,"chars":[4],"who":"Lucy","text":"Half a minute.","de":"Halbe Minute.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":103.55,"end":105.209,"chars":[1],"who":"Kiwi","text":"No time, finish up.","de":"Keine Zeit, macht fertig.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":105.295,"end":107.902,"chars":[4],"who":"Lucy","text":"Dobra, zrobione","de":"Okay, fertig.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":108.397,"end":110.702,"chars":[3],"who":"David","text":"Locked.","de":"Zu.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":110.163,"end":111.692,"chars":[4],"who":"Lucy","text":"Did you restore the security?","de":"Hast du die Sicherungen wieder aktiviert?","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":111.692,"end":113.76,"chars":[1],"who":"Kiwi","text":"Like I said — time's up.","de":"Wie gesagt — Zeit um.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/31.mp3"},{"t":113.373,"end":116.97,"chars":[5],"who":"Wachmann","text":"OTWIERAJ PIEPRZONY SZCZYLU","de":"MACH AUF, VERDAMMTER SCHLÜSSEL!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/32.mp3"},{"t":117.379,"end":120.632,"chars":[5],"who":"Wachmann","text":"OPEN THE FUCK UP","de":"MACH AUF, ZUM TEUFEL!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/33.mp3"},{"t":118.047,"end":120.632,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"Shit there's no way out — go!","de":"Scheiße, kein Ausweg — leg los!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/34.mp3"},{"t":120.46,"end":121.149,"chars":[3],"who":"David","text":"Co!?","de":"Was!?","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/35.mp3"},{"t":120.58,"end":129.097,"chars":[5],"who":"Wachmann","text":"(improvise insults), YOU'RE DEAD YOU BITCH","de":"DU BIST TODESKANDIDAT, VERDAMMTE SCHEISSE!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/36.mp3"},{"t":121.58,"end":122.872,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"Go little man","de":"Fahr, Kleiner!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/37.mp3"},{"t":122.743,"end":124.682,"chars":[3],"who":"David","text":"But I can't drive!","de":"Aber ich kann nicht fahren!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/38.mp3"},{"t":125.027,"end":126.427,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"You'll learn.","de":"Wirst du lernen.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/39.mp3"},{"t":129.766,"end":135.496,"chars":[5],"who":"Wachmann","text":"YOU HEAR ME?! FUCK YOU'RE DEAD, HEY","de":"HÖRST DU MICH?! VERDAMMT, DU BIST TOT — HEEEY!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/40.mp3"},{"t":131.597,"end":135.345,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"Show me you've got what it takes.","de":"Zeig mir, dass du taugst.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/41.mp3"},{"t":136.077,"end":140.73,"chars":[5],"who":"Wachmann","text":"YOU'RE DEAD FOR FUCK'S SAKE, (improvise insults)","de":"DU BIST TOT, ZUM TEUFEL!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/42.mp3"},{"t":140.989,"end":148.033,"chars":[5],"who":"Wachmann","text":"AA STOOOP MY CAR STOP YOU ASSHOLE OAAAA FUCK","de":"AA STOPP — MEIN AUTO, STOPP DU SCHWEIN — OAAAA SCHEISSE!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/43.mp3"},{"t":148.14,"end":154.301,"chars":[5],"who":"Wachmann","text":"HEEEY I'M TALKING TO YOU BITCH STOOOP STOP","de":"HEEEEY ICH RED MIT DIR, SCHLAMPE — STOPP, STOPP!","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/44.mp3"},{"t":154.991,"end":161.863,"chars":[0],"who":"Maine","text":"Hahahaha good thing this isn't my ride. Take it straight to Aldo's — GPS is on.","de":"Hahahaha gut, dass das nicht meine Karre ist. Fahr direkt zu Aldo — GPS ist an.","orig":"scenes/edgerunnerscar/lines/45.mp3"}]}